 # Description:
-#   OpenCV libraries for video/image processing on MacOS
+#   Statically linked OpenCV libraries for macOS. The referenced install
+#   prefix is produced by a cmake build with BUILD_SHARED_LIBS=OFF and
+#   BUILD_LIST=core,imgcodecs,imgproc (see source/README.md). zlib is
